Z||000008||artherd||09-29-2001||01:17 AM||||Hi there, you sound like me  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P> <IMG SRC="http://www.cartsys.com/stuff/images/theatre.jpg"> <P>That's my 6-track mastering studio<P>Withought tooting my own horn too much, I'll say that I did build everything in those pics from scratch (I even rebuilt that projector  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif"><P>I'm going with Focal drivers in my fiero, I love their detail and precision.  Not sure how they will sound in such a small volume as an automobile, this is new territory for me, but should be exciting!!<P>Would like to hear more about your project, and your studio!<P>Best!<BR>Ben.<P><BR> <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by ds21:<BR><B>I'm still working on the details/programing of my computer based stereo/gps system. Don't yet know what in going to run for amps or speakers, I DON"T want the everyday stuff ie; Rockford-Alpine-MTX.<BR>Maybe Focal-Dynaudio-Genesis-Butler!<BR>I run my own Hard disk based Studio and have been building my own home speakers for many years. <BR>I've done some really acurate sounding systems for other. Time for my own.<BR>What kind of setup are/do you run!</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P><P>------------------<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.cartsys.com/fiero/88ttop.jpg">  <BR>Ben Cannon<BR>88 Formula, T-top Metalic Red<BR>88 Formula, Silver<BR>87 Coupe, Metalic Red<BR>"Every Man Dies, not every man really Lives"<BR>                -Mel Gibson, "Braveheart"||||reg||3
